  "result": "I fixed the three webhook problems in the code. I did not run the test suite.\n\n- **Switching off doesn't stick:** `updateEndpoint` in `src/server/repositories/webhook-repository.ts` dropped `enabled: false` because of a `&&` check. It now applies any explicit boolean, so switching off and back on both persist. New events already skip disabled endpoints in `enqueueForOrg` in `src/server/services/webhook-service.ts`.\n- **Queued deliveries still go out:** `src/server/jobs/webhook-delivery-job.ts` now marks a claimed delivery failed with \"endpoint is switched off\" when its endpoint is disabled. It counts that as failed, and deliveries for enabled endpoints are unchanged.\n- **Switched-off endpoints escape the allowance:** `createWebhook` in `src/server/services/webhook-service.ts` now counts all endpoints, not just enabled ones, against the plan limit.",
